                                "sense_id": "3c51c8cf-9694-3ace-a479-afd45619de43",
                                "text": "They ſay this tovvne is full of coſenage: / As nimble Iuglers that deceiue the eie: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "968c6c83-a8dc-48db-90ed-dc2d2c38c59f",
                                "sense_id": "3c51c8cf-9694-3ace-a479-afd45619de43",
                                "text": "I ask you, What is human life? Is it not a maimed happiness—care and weariness, weariness and care, with a baseless expectation, the strange cozenage of a brighter tomorrow?"
                            }
